libfvalue
------------------------------------------
libfvalue is a library for generic file value functions.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue-devel-20260531-1bl1
  libfvalue1-20260531-1bl1
  libfwnt1-20260602-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfwnt-devel-20260602-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfvalue

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfvalue/archive/refs/tags/20260531.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfvalue-20260531-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfvalue-20260531-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfvalue-20260531-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfvalue-20260531-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfvalue1-20260531-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfvalue-devel-20260531-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

